<title>SINGAPORE: Cosco to take 70 pct stake in Costar.</title>
<headline>Cosco to take 70 pct stake in Costar.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cosco Investment (Singapore) Ltd (Cosco) said on Monday it had agreed to spend Singapore $4 million on a 70 percent stake in shipping firm Costar Shipping Pte Ltd.</p>
<p>Cosco said in a statement the S$4 million price tag was four times Costar's net profit in the year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>Cosco Holdings (Singapore) Pte Ltd, Costar's former parent, has guaranteed that earnings for the current year will not be less than S$1.4 million.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703011)</p>
